					<li><a href="/sitemap/index.asp"><strong>TWDB Site Map</strong></a>: It has all basic important links to the entire site.</li>
					<li><a href="/search/index.asp"><strong>Search</strong></a>: It will help to locate a page you are looking for.</li>
					<li><a href="mailto:webmaster@twdb.texas.gov"><strong>Contact Webmaster</strong></a>: If for some reason, the page you are looking for can't be found or this is result from one of the links in this site, please contact <a href="mailto:webmaster@twdb.texas.gov">webmaster@twdb.texas.gov</a>.</li>
				</ol>
				<p class="informed"><strong>Note: When you are sending an e-mail to the webmaster, please be as detailed as possible to better assist you.  Our normal turn around time is the next business day.</strong></p>
			</div>			
